{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["לא יטמא בעל בעמיו — no husband among the people of the priests shall defile himself for his wife." "להחלו — for he becomes profaned from his priesthood. (And according to the Sages' words: he does not defile himself for a disqualified wife or a ḥalalah, but he does defile himself for his qualified wife.)"], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:09.593498761Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}